<p>Nana ne nawaase ne zaher ek sa paaya<br />
Ummat ne risalat ka ajr khoob nibhaaya</p>

<p>1. Milte hi sam ke Ahmad e Muqtaar pukaare<br />
Aye bhai Ali(a.s) paas zara aao hamaare<br />
Aaye Ali(a.s) to inko ajab haal me paaya<br />
Ummat ne risalat ka ajr khoob nibhaaya</p>

<p>2.Shabbar(a.s) ko tha jab zehre halahal pila diya<br />
Saidaniyou'n me ek ajab hashr tha bapa<br />
Zainab(s.a) ne roke bas yahi shabbir(a.s) se kaha<br />
Ummat ne risalat ka ajr khoob nibhaaya</p>

<p>3.Allah ke Nabi ka janaaza tha youn utha<br />
juz Alhebait(a.s) koi bhi shaamil nahi hua<br />
Ummat ne Fatima(s.a) ko baher haal rulaaya<br />
Ummat ne risalat ka ajr khoob nibhaaya</p>

<p>4.Taboot par Hassan(a.s) ke tha teero'n ka saayebaa'n<br />
Rote the dekh dekh ke ye sarware zamaa'n<br />
pehlu me mohammad(saw) ke bhi dafnaane na diya<br />
Ummat ne risalat ka ajr khoob nibhaaya</p>

<p>5. Matam karo ek aaj Qayaamat ka roz hai<br />
do Masoomou'n ki aaj shahadat ka roz hai<br />
Aye <b>Asghari</b> duayei'n tumhe dengi Syeda(s.a)<br />
Ummat ne risalat ka ajr khoob nibhaaya<br />
</p>

